==============================================================================
P6d SCOPE 2 — FINAL ASSESSMENT
==============================================================================

The by-name search found no on-disk candidate for 9 of the 10 synthetic
priors. The 10th (omega_social) has many files, but every candidate
lives in XAI_Social_Games_Data, which is the same source that produced
lambda_ineq. Using the same dataset for two parameters is not independent
grounding.

This reconnaissance block reads the actual COLUMN headers of every
task file to check for hidden variables. If, for example, the BART task
contains a "pump_decision_after_loss" column, that could proxy u_U. If
the HCP EMOTION task contains a "fear_face_accuracy" column, that could
proxy theta_T. If the DASS item set contains items that map onto a
transient mood construct distinct from general distress, that could
proxy m_t.

Without column-level evidence, the honest conclusion is that P6d-Rebuild
requires external data acquisition for 9 of the 10 priors.

